m/godotengine/godot/pull/98653.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-12T01:00:49Z"},"body":"While a healthy chunk of the generated scripts are using the new wrapper formatting, that isn't the case for everything in the repo. Specifically, scripts that were part of the SCons pipeline already weren't included in the native generation PR[^1]. While a bit later than I initially intended, this is a followup to that PR to apply the same glowup to other builders. In addition to cleaning up the build scripts themselves, the actual contents of the generated files were updated to utilize `constexpr` where appropriate. This deliberately excludes the shader builders, as those necessitate a more involved pass & I'd rather not get hung up on that when the rest of the bulk changes remain fairly isolated.\r\n\r\n[^1]: #91624","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98653/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue